  "text": "The unit's run-time values have per-run override files beside the document. The generated root task runs with one file's values as its CONFIG defaults and loads an override with LoadParameterFile when a run passes CONFIG 'param_file'. A run that uses another file needs it in the expected JSON shape on a stage, passed with EXECUTE TASK ... USING CONFIG. {detail}",
  "text_lint": {
